# Sample values for `npx wrangler dev`. Copy this file to .dev.vars (gitignored).
# The value below is a fixed, clearly nonproduction sample -- never use it in
# production. Set the real secret with: npx wrangler secret put COMMUNITY_IP_SECRET
COMMUNITY_IP_SECRET=local-dev-sample-secret-not-for-production
# The bug report form's GitHub token (POST /api/report). This sample is not a
# token, so a local report fails at GitHub, the Worker deletes what it stored,
# and the form points to Discord. Never put a real token here: a local report
# with one would open a real public issue. The production secret is set with:
# npx wrangler secret put GITHUB_REPORT_TOKEN
GITHUB_REPORT_TOKEN=local-dev-sample-not-a-github-token
